      "message": "fix(test): give stock_in_vise_sim's LocateSpec its body\n\nPR #2184 added the required field LocateSpec::body; PR #2182 added this\ntest with the old literal. Each built alone; merged back to back the test\nbuild fails (E0063). Use body: Default::default() (LocateBody::Part, the\npre-#2184 meaning), as the other LocateSpec test literals do.\n\nFixes #2297\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAAAJyAPrC37zBzbbX",
